    "content": "## World Versus World\n```yaml\n1-50 player vs player content\nRecommended for level 80```WvW is very different from PvE. You need to be experienced in fighting against other players while also good at working together in a group. WvW is also the most graphically intense gamemode, so you may need to lower your graphic settings.\n- <@&772184719286599781>: lessons on how to survive group fights in WvW. \n- <@&1006203805085479073>: Notifications for WvW groups running (Must either be in the GWU guild and have it selected as WvW team, or be in another guild from the same team).\nSee https://discord.com/channels/446550730640195586/771894823074398209 for more details.",
