    "content": "## Raids\n```yaml\n10 player instance content\nRecommended for level 80```Raids are endgame PvE content from Heart of Thorns, Path of Fire, and Janthir Wilds\n- <@&845100161902575628>: Brand new to raids! Must have a general understanding of your class, what role you are filling, what your CC skills are, and appropriate gear (exotic or higher) for your role. \n- <@&845100170151985163>: You have trained on or completed raid bosses. Progression runs contain minimal explanations. Clear runs contain no explanations. Please only sign up for content you meet the requirements of.\nSee https://discord.com/channels/446550730640195586/771100743368179752 for more details.",
