    "type": 0,
    "content": "## Fractals\n```yaml\n5 player instance content\nRecommended for level 71+```Fractals are great for learning how to play instanced group content and earning high quality gear.\n- <@&845098867552550922>: essentially dungeons. No agony resistance (AR) required. \n- <@&845099034464354345>: similar to T1 but harder. 50+ AR required. \n- <@&845099039853903892>: much harder version of T2. 100+ AR required.\n- <@&845099302569115648>: very hard version of T3. 150+ AR required. \n- <@&845099541929263134>: You have completed fractals on normal and are looking for training, progression, or clears of the CMs. Please only sign up for content you meet the requirements of.\nSee https://discord.com/channels/446550730640195586/771110507758354442 for more details.",
