    "type": 0,
    "content": "## Open World\n```yaml\n1-50 player open content\nContent for all levels``` Open World encompasses everything open world and story related content.  \n- <@&845100314079264799>  : Social events and trains\n  - Guild Missions, fishing parties, etc.\n  - Achievement Farming - Going for some specific achievements in story instances/open world.\n  - Map/World Completion - 100% completion on a specific map. Completing every heart, viewing every vista, finding every point of interest, earning every hero challenge.\n  - Hero Point Trains - Farm the expansion maps for all the hero challenges to help unlock your elite specializations. \n  - Bounty Train - Farm the Path of Fire expansion maps for bounties. \n- <@&1319648281600589905>  : (level 80) Group up in some expansion maps with many players to tackle big event chains called meta events. \nSee https://discord.com/channels/446550730640195586/1138843634729500753 for more details.",
